            {
                "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                "word": "cottonwood",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c3ec450d-359c-435c-b350-79b0a2708722",
                        "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cottonwoods"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf899f5e-6157-35eb-bbc0-89fd83e9992b",
                        "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tree from one of number of species of tree in the genus Populus (poplars), typically growing along watercourses, with fluffy catkins."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af7fe0fe-32c8-4ce9-9142-4e2737314956",
                                "sense_id": "cf899f5e-6157-35eb-bbc0-89fd83e9992b",
                                "text": "Between these canyons the river has a low but rather narrow flood plain, with cottonwood groves scattered here and there, and a chaparral of mesquite bearing beans and thorns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1ec8096-a983-4638-8677-8945354be152",
                                "sense_id": "cf899f5e-6157-35eb-bbc0-89fd83e9992b",
                                "text": "[…] and through the middle of this forest, from wall to wall, ran a winding line of brilliant green which marked the course of cottonwoods and willows."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f55d4ff-7746-3474-9db6-d1c4255a166c",
                        "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Populus sect. Aigeiros, a taxonomic section of the poplar genus"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c8dc00dd-db32-3c90-89e8-2ab4e34f31f2",
                        "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cottonwood hibiscus (Talipariti tiliaceum, syn. Hibiscus tiliaceus), a flowering shrub or tree in the mallow family."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "151ff6a5-5f16-3c69-8e06-14156ed5f739",
                        "entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A tree of species Ceiba pentandra, native to the American tropics and west Africa; silk-cotton tree."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f3cf71d-2161-49ed-a77c-cd28560a04c0",
                                "sense_id": "151ff6a5-5f16-3c69-8e06-14156ed5f739",
                                "text": "There is no break in the trees. That is the wonder and the mystery of it. There where you see light-green rushes instead of dark-green undergrowth, there between the great cotton woods, that is my private gate into the unknown."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcf48cbf-002c-42cd-96ae-a70c6088904e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
                        "source_sense_description": "tree from Populus with fluffy catkins",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pappel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pappel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                        "entry_id": "639193f2-7ee0-34d2-83fc-61a565af9048",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "baumartiges Weidengewächs (Gattung Populus)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4b58658-a1c2-4345-981a-b5b43a39ae4a",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                                "text": "Entlang dieser Straße werden Pappeln gepflanzt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b39e261-8f90-4af1-b170-985510044ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                                "text": "„Der Abenddunst zog durch die kahlen Pappeln und verwischte ihre Konturen mit violettem Schimmer, der noch blasser und durchsichtiger war als ein in ihrem Gezweig hängengebliebener zarter Gazeschleier.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a42b9a8-364f-4ed8-bbfc-d6c43d2a54bf",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                                "text": "„Der Wind weht Pollen aus den Pappeln und treibt sie über das Wasser.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca2f1aa0-bb9d-4863-99ed-cd77e531591b",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                                "text": "„Die Pappeln, die die Straße säumen, biegen sich zur Mitte hin und bilden einen Tunnel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd9d4cd8-bce5-423d-8912-d278443d9d60",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e6614-074a-31d4-929b-f9a72489b937",
                                                "text": "„Bei den Pappeln konnte man problemlos ins Wasser steigen und baden, wenn man wollte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f142a5c0-d090-3618-b01d-75b301b808a3",
                                        "entry_id": "639193f2-7ee0-34d2-83fc-61a565af9048",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Volksname für einige Malvengewächse (Familie Malvaceae)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in Zusammensetzungen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78f284c6-7e67-4a1d-82b0-6708c8cfd3dd",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a3d6e89-253f-33a2-bf53-d8ec81b63fa9",
